==Russian==

===Etymology===
Originally used by Cossacks, likely of {{der|ru|trk}} origin. Compare {{cog|tt|баш}}. Also see {{l|ru|башловка|t=the top share of Cossacks' loot, given to the leader or bravest Cossack.}}.

===Pronunciation===
